{ralte} is about having something on your person. You can't {ralte} a
typical {zdani} (except, for example, a cardboard box You can {ponse} a
{zdani}, but this is rather different from {se zdani}-ing the {zdani}. For
example, you might own a property that you rent out while residing
elsewhere; then you {ponse} but do not {se zdani}. Conversely you might be
the renter; then you {se zdani} but do not {ponse}.

